        <h2>AI Policy</h2>
        <h3>Website Images</h3>
        <p>
        All images shown on this website were created without the use of AI. This includes, but is not limited to, all photography and 
        images of paintings. Also, I do not use AI in any part of my painting process. This includes the taking, assembling and preparation of reference images.
        </p>
        <h3>Website Written Content</h3>
        <p>
        All articles and other content in this website were created without the use of AI, with the following exceptions:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>
            Microsoft Editor: used to assist with spell checking and grammar correction in some recent blog articles.
            </li>
            <li>
            Microsoft Copilot: used to assist with the preparation of parts of code samples in some blog articles
            </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="fw-bold">
            Simon Bland, Kansas City 2026
        </p>
